<p><a href="/autopilot/reviews">← Back to Agent reviews</a></p><h1>Foreign purchase currency exposure</h1>
<p>Compare the open goods on foreign-currency purchase orders with your checked original rate. The latest ECB reference rates are estimates for information; your bank or supplier provides the actual transaction quote. Freight, duty, deposits and bank charges need their separate cost review.</p>
<% if(rates){ %><p>ECB reference date: <strong><%= rates.date %></strong> · Accounting currency: <%= base %> · <a href="https://www.ecb.europa.eu/stats/policy_and_exchange_rates/euro_reference_exchange_rates/html/index.en.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View the rate source</a></p><% } %>
<% if(problem){ %><p class="notice"><%= problem %></p><% } %>
<% if(!allowed){ %><p class="notice"><strong>Starter</strong> provides one read-only purchase suggestion at a time. <strong>Growth / Pro / Custom</strong> can save checked comparison rates and include this review in a scheduled owner playbook. <a class="btn" href="/billing">Upgrade</a></p><% } %>
<% if(chosen){ %><section class="card"><div class="card-body"><h2><%= chosen.po_number %> · <%= chosen.supplier_name %></h2><p>Open recorded goods: <strong><%= helpers.money(chosen.outstandingMinor,chosen.currency) %></strong>.</p>
<% if(result?.current!=null){ %><p>Latest reference estimate: <strong><%= helpers.money(result.current,base) %></strong><% if(result.original!=null){ %> · At your checked rate: <%= helpers.money(result.original,base) %><% } %>.</p><% if(result.change!=null){ %><p>Reference estimate <%= result.change>0?'increase':result.change<0?'decrease':'change' %>: <strong><%= helpers.money(Math.abs(result.change),base) %></strong>.</p><% } %><% } %>
<% if(result?.problem){ %><p class="notice"><%= result.problem %></p><% } %><% if(saved){ %><p>Checked basis: 1 <%= chosen.currency %> = <%= saved.base_per_foreign %> <%= saved.base_currency %> · <%= saved.quote_date %> · <%= saved.source_reference %></p><% } %>
<p><a href="/purchasing/orders/<%= chosen.id %>">Open purchase order</a> · <a href="/autopilot/purchase-fx">All open foreign purchases</a></p>
<% if(allowed){ %><h3>Confirm the original comparison rate</h3><p>Copy the original bank, supplier or budget quote you actually checked. This saves a comparison basis; transaction and book amounts keep their own financial approval.</p><form class="form-stack" method="post" action="/autopilot/purchase-fx/baseline"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="purchaseOrderId" value="<%= chosen.id %>"><input type="hidden" name="sourceHash" value="<%= chosen.sourceHash %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= saved?.revision||0 %>">
<label><%= base %> for 1 <%= chosen.currency %><input required name="basePerForeign" inputmode="decimal" value="<%= saved?.base_per_foreign||'' %>" maxlength="24"></label><label>Original quote date<input required name="quotedOn" type="date" value="<%= saved?.quote_date||'' %>"></label><label>Original quote or budget reference<input required name="sourceReference" maxlength="200" value="<%= saved?.source_reference||'' %>"></label><label><input required type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes"> I checked the original quote, its date and the rate direction shown above.</label><button class="btn btn--primary">Save checked comparison rate</button></form><% } %></div></section><% } %>
<section class="card"><div class="card-body"><h2>Open foreign purchases</h2><% if(!rows.length){ %><p>No open foreign-currency purchase orders.</p><% }else{ %><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Purchase order</th><th>Supplier</th><th>Open goods</th><th>Reference estimate</th><th>Change</th><th>Review</th></tr></thead><tbody><% rows.forEach(r=>{ %><tr><td><a href="/autopilot/purchase-fx?<%= new URLSearchParams({order:r.id}) %>"><%= r.po_number %></a></td><td><%= r.supplier_name %></td><td><%= r.outstandingMinor==null?'Needs price / unit review':helpers.money(r.outstandingMinor,r.currency) %></td><td><%= r.current==null?'Unavailable':helpers.money(r.current,base) %></td><td><%= r.change==null?'Not established':helpers.money(r.change,base) %></td><td><%= r.problem||(r.change>0?'Reference estimate increased':r.change<0?'Reference estimate decreased':'No change at this precision') %></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div><% } %><p><% if(page>1){ %><a href="/autopilot/purchase-fx?page=<%= page-1 %>">Previous</a><% } %><% if(more){ %> <a href="/autopilot/purchase-fx?page=<%= page+1 %>">Next 100 purchases</a><% } %></p><p>For recurring private results, include <strong>Review foreign purchase currency exposure</strong> in an owner-approved daily or weekly <a href="/autopilot/playbooks">playbook</a>.</p></div></section>
